# Noisy Article With Ads

The page contains real article text surrounded by navigation, advertising, and footer clutter.

The cleaner should remove obvious chrome while retaining the central narrative and useful source links.

## What Matters

The meaningful section explains how a static HTML reader should prefer paragraphs, lists, and article bodies.

- Keep the primary article body.
- Drop repeated site navigation.
- Keep relevant inline links such as analysis notes.


